  "rationale": "The workflow is a minimal daily scheduled stale-issue/PR marker (one job, one step, actions/stale@v11, ~10s runs, all successes in history). Evaluated schedule-related patterns: P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE requires an approved monitored pause/resume policy (not present) and there is no failure streak to suppress; P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE is contraindicated because the workflow is inherently time-based (stale/close thresholds depend on elapsed time, not just repository changes) and needs fresh periodic checks. P-LIT-GHA-CACHE has no applicable dependency-installation step in this workflow to cache (requirements.txt is not referenced by this workflow). P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT would not meaningfully optimize runs that already complete in seconds with no evidence of runaway executions. No supported pattern has met preconditions without contraindications for this workflow.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE", "P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE", "P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT"]
}
